<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Shell, United Meridian in Ivory Coast exploration.</title>
<headline>Shell, United Meridian in Ivory Coast exploration.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast has signed a deal with a consortium of Royal Dutch/Shell Group and United Meridian Corp for deep sea exploration and development in offshore Bloc C-105 southwest of Abidjan for a maximum period of seven years, said Damien Degheldere, vice-president of United Meridian Cote d'Ivoire, on Saturday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters exploration would start in October.</p>
</text>
